{"id":"n5-050","title":"Verb ないで ください","romaji":"〜naide kudasai","jlptLevel":5,"shortExplanation":"Used to make a polite request for someone not to do something; 'please don't'.","longExplanation":"The grammar point Verb ないで ください is used to make a polite request for someone not to do a certain action. In English, it can be translated as 'please don't'. To form this expression, take the verb in its negative form (ない-form) and add で ください.","formation":"Verb-ない-form + で ください","examples":[{"jp":"タバコを吸わないでください。","romaji":"Tabako wo suwanaide kudasai.","en":"Please don't smoke.","words":[{"surface":"タバコ","vocabId":"1597150","reading":"タバコ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"吸わ","vocabId":"1228260","reading":"すわ","baseForm":"吸う"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ください","vocabId":"1184280","reading":"ください","baseForm":"くださる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5]},{"jp":"ここで走らないでください。","romaji":"Koko de hashiranaide kudasai.","en":"Please don't run here.","words":[{"surface":"ここ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"走ら","vocabId":"1402540","reading":"はしら","baseForm":"走る"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ください","vocabId":"1184280","reading":"ください","baseForm":"くださる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5]},{"jp":"大きな声で話さないでください。","romaji":"Ookina koe de hanasanaide kudasai.","en":"Please don't speak loudly.","words":[{"surface":"大きな","vocabId":null},{"surface":"声","vocabId":"1380440","reading":"こえ"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"話さ","vocabId":"1562350","reading":"はなさ","baseForm":"話す"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ください","vocabId":"1184280","reading":"ください","baseForm":"くださる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6]},{"jp":"写真を撮らないでください。","romaji":"Shashin wo toranaide kudasai.","en":"Please don't take photos.","words":[{"surface":"写真","vocabId":"1321